{"type":"message","id":"34e2c74a","parentId":"341310b6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:13:46.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST to /send is returning 1101. The worker is crashing on the /send endpoint. This is a backend bug.\n\nGiven that:\n1. The platform is returning 1101 (Worker exception) for all /send requests\n2. There are no human discussions to respond to in either thread\n3. Both threads are full of automated heartbeat messages\n\nI should report the status clearly. The /send endpoint appears broken (1101 Worker exception). The heartbeat cron still ran and checked both threads - no human discussions found. \n\nActually wait - let me think about what a meaningful response would be here. If the /send endpoint is broken, I can't post heartbeats. \n\nBut this is a heartbeat cron task, so if I can't post heartbeats, that's a significant issue. I tried different API key formats - the Bearer token gave 401 Unauthorized while X-API-Key with POST gave 1101, which suggests the endpoint exists but crashes when trying to process the request body. The GET endpoint works fine though, so maybe there's a workaround I haven't tried yet.\n\nI should report back that the /send endpoint appears broken due to a Worker exception, while noting that there are no new human discussions requiring response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 01:10 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最后消息 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975602235），仅系统自动 Heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最后消息 23:45 UTC（msg_1778975171537），仅系统自动 Heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| **新增讨论** | 无 |\n| **需要响应** | 无 |\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 异常），POST 请求均无法成功。所有格式（`threadId`+`content`、`message`+`thread` 等）均报同样错误。`GET /history` 和根路由工作正常，仅 `POST /send` 崩溃。\n\n**行动建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Platform 后端 `/send` 路由的 Worker 代码 — 疑似 JSON body 解析或路由处理逻辑异常导致 Worker 抛出未捕获异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1150,"output":468,"cacheRead":20000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21618,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778980406657,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6b434a00-a50b-47f5-aec1-39204083ed8d"}}
